            "review_title": "Review at Helios Cocktail",
            "review_text": "stayathomedad\nSolihull261 contributions\n0\nA great bar in Central Can Tho. Go there!\nMar 2025 • Couples\nWe like to seek out interesting bars wherever we go, a little outside the obvious choices of hotels or main street locations. Helios is an excellent option and strongly recommended; the cocktails were delicious, the bar was cool and the guys behind the bar really knew their stuff. We had a floral gin-based cocktail which was so delicious we had to order another. My standard order is a Negroni so I can compare bars; this was really good too and compared strongly against many others in our 21- day Vietnam trip.\n\nThe draught craft lager (BiA) was very pleasant but I can't recall the name! A side order of \"chicken nuggets\" was tasty and filling, perfect to accompany the great drinks.\n\nIncredibly friendly people too, and the music playlist was immaculate in my opinion. We had a wonderful evening. Right up there with the coolest bars we went to in HCMC and Hanoi.\nRead more\nWritten March 20, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
