            "review_title": "Review at Helios Cocktail",
            "review_text": "Flowersinthewindow\nLondon, United Kingdom59 contributions\n0\nFabulous cocktails - worth a visit.\nDec 2024 • Couples\nGreat place. Don’t be put off by the very dark interior. \n\nLovely cocktail place, friendly staff and some of the best cocktails we have had in Asia. \nBeating the intercontinental Singapore by a country mile. \n\nHighly recommend the Negroni, Old Fashioned and craft beer. \n\nHave a couple, chill and head somewhere else. Food options not really worth pursuing.\nRead more\nWritten December 24, 2024",
