            "review_title": "Review at Helios Cocktail",
            "review_text": "Geoff3195\nParkdale, Australia40 contributions\n0\nJust opened but already kicking goals\nJun 2018 • Couples\nJust off the main drag in Can Tho is this little gem of a bar. Cool decor and even cooler music match a sophisticated cocktail menu. \nThe drinks aren’t necessarily inexpensive but they are beautifully made and well presented. A range of beers and other mixed drinks are available. \nThis is a most welcome addition to the city and deserving of a couple of hours - ideal for adventurous drinkers. \nExcellent bar staff and a first class mixologist make this worthy of a big night out.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 23, 2018",
